DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 18-36 m
 onths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin Miss Rebecca on Wednesday mornings f
 or story time tailored for you and your terrific toddler! The program incl
 udes songs\, rhymes and books\, plus literacy tips you can practice at hom
 e. Participants are encouraged to bring their own stuffed animal or doll f
 or "The Elevator Song." For children 1 to 3 and their caregivers. How to A
